From: mellon@fenris.pa.dec.com (Ted Lemon)

Actually, what you need to do is the following:

On your Ultrix machine, type

cd /usr/lib/X11/fonts/decwin
find . -name "*.pcf" -print >fonts.path

and then set your font path to yourhostaddress:/usr/lib/X11/fonts/fonts.path.

I seem to recall that I was able to find this in the documentation,
but it took me a while...   BTW, I don't believe that VT1000 version
1.0 ROMS work properly with TCP/IP - I upgraded my VT1000 to version
1.1 before I got it to work.   I believe that the ROM version is shown
in the Upper Left Corner of the VT1000 session manager window.
