> who may have some experience with these beasts (DEC 58XX ).

If you want a DEC system/server in the form of a traditional cabinet oriented
system, the 5800 is a pretty good deal, we're fairly happy.  For more modest
needs you may want to consider DS5400 or DS5000 solutions.

Other vendors offer server oriented systems which do better on benchmarks,
cost less and have cheaper/open memory/peripheral expansion options.  It's not
obvious when/if DEC will respond fully to these issues.

