4-3 DECSYSTEM 5000 MODEL 200 FACT SHEET

PRODUCT NAME:  DECsystem 5000 Model 200

OVERVIEW:

The DECsystem 5000 Model 200 computer is a general purpose,
multi-user RISC system.  When configured with a large number of
disks, the DECsystem 5000 Model 200 system is an ideal file
server for small work groups.  As a compute server, it can be
used to offload compute-intensive tasks and graphics applications
from local workstations.  The system can also provide excellent
multi-user, timesharing capabilities through the use of remote
logins.

The DECsystem 5000 Model 200 system offers the same 24 MIPS
performance as the DECstation 5000 Model 200 family of
workstations, but has more TURBOchannel slots available for
option cards because the system does not require any graphics
cards.  The system can support up to three Small Computer Systems
Interface (SCSI) controllers in addition to the SCSI controller
that comes standard with each system.

KEY FEATURES:
    o  MIPS R3000 CPU and R3010 FPU and LSI Logic LR3220 Write
       Buffer chipsets, operating at 25 MHz and providing 24 MIPS
       (Dhrystone V1.1) performance.
    o  8 to 120 Mbytes of Error Correction Code (ECC) system
       memory.
    o  128 Kbytes of total system cache; 64 Kbytes of data cache
       and 64 Kbytes of instruction cache.
    o  ThinWire Ethernet connector and BNC port (expandable
       through TURBOchannel option slots to a total of three
       supported Ethernet ports.)
    o  Small Computer Systems Interface (SCSI) controller
       provides up to 5 Mbytes per second of I/O bandwidth, and
       supports up to seven external SCSI devices.
    o  Three TURBOchannel slots, which can access 93
       Mbytes-per-second burst transfer rates, for expansion and
       support of peripheral devices which connect to
       industry-standard VME or SCSI busses.
    o  Two RS232 25-pin serial ports support printers, modems,
       and 3D dial and button box devices.
    o  One RS232 15-pin serial port for a keyboard and mouse or
       tablet.

Base Price Configuration:
       -  8 Mbytes ECC Memory (120 Mbytes maximum capacity).
       -  Diskless (maximum disk capacity TBD).

U.S. Price:  The DECsystem is priced at $14,995 and is available
             immediately.

                               ###

DECsystem, ThinWire and TURBOchannel are trademarks of Digital
Equipment Corporation.
