      -	DECsystem 5810 prices starting at $75,000
      -	DECsystem 5820 prices starting at $115,000
      -	DECsystem 5830 prices starting at $140,000
      -	DECsystem 5840 prices starting at $160,000

    o Upgrade Prices:
      In-cabinet upgrades within the DECsystem 5800 series are
      available:
      -	DECsystem 5810 to DECsystem 5820 upgrade -- $50,000
      -	DECsystem 5820 to DECsystem 5830 upgrade -- $50,000
      -	DECsystem 5830 to DECsystem 5840 upgrade -- $50,000

All U.S. pricing includes paid-up licenses and Product Foundation
Warranty.

Availability:
The DECsystem 5810 and DECsystem 5820 computers are available
now; the DECsystem 5830 and DECsystem 5840 computers will be
available in June.

