4-3 RZ57 DISK DRIVE FACT SHEET

Product Name:  RZ57, 1GB, 5.25-inch Disk Drive

Overview:	

Digital's new 1 GB, 5.25 inch, full height Winchester technology RZ57
disk drive provides high capacity, high performance, dependable
storage for users running data-intensive applications on Digital
Workstations, including the new DECsystem 5000 series.  The drive is
available as add-on storage for workstations:  on the new DECsystem
5000 series, up to 21 devices (using Turbo Channel) are supported for
a total of 21 GB; on VAXstation 3100s, up to 4 external devices are
supported, for a total of 4 GB; and on the DECstation 2100/3100 up to
5 devices are supported for a total of 5 GB.

The RZ57 disk drive is the highest capacity member of the RZ series of
drives employing  the Small Computer System Interface, or SCSI. Thin
film technology provides high capacity, and rotary voice coil
actuators enable the RZ57 drive to achieve an average access time of
22.8 milliseconds.  Data integrity is enhanced with 48-bit ECC (error
correction code) and sophisticated defect management in the on-board
SCSI controller.  Field replaceability of disk drive components means
that data are preserved if circuit boards are replaced.  Additionally,
the RZ57, like other members of the RZ series of drives, is designed
to complete the current write operation in progress before powering
down.

Key Features:
    o 1 GB  of formatted storage capacity in a 5.25 inch, full height
      form factor
    o 22.8 millisecond average access time
    o SCSI-based technology
    o Drive diagnostics integrated with workstation diagnostics for
      exceptional dependability
    o Data protection with field-replaceable units
    o Un-segmented 256 Kbyte buffer
    o Quiet operation in the desktop environment

Price:  $10,000 Single 1 GB Formatted drive in storage expansion box
        $20,500 TWO 1.0 GB formatted in a BA42 dual-drive expansion
        box.  One year standard warranty.  Available immediately.
        	Customer installable.

